# The second route's timer (SPEC-396 R2; ADR-410): every ten minutes, with a short random delay so
# it never fires in step with the other timers. The calendar is written in UTC. With no Unit=, the
# timer starts the service of its own name.
[Unit]
Description=DeckStreak's second route, every ten minutes
X-DurableServices-Waive=calendar-not-persistent a run reads the service manager's current state, which a missed run cannot lose, and the next run ten minutes later reads it again

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:00/10:00 UTC
RandomizedDelaySec=30s
AccuracySec=1us

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
